+## Advanced Features
+
+### Label Positioning
+
+Fine-tune label placement:
+
+```mermaid-example
+component Name [visibility, evolution] label [offsetX, offsetY]
+```
+
+```mermaid
+component Name [visibility, evolution] label [offsetX, offsetY]
+```
+
+Negative X moves left, positive X moves right.
+Negative Y moves up, positive Y moves down.
+
+### Custom Canvas Size
+
+```mermaid-example
+wardley
+title Custom Size
+size [800, 1000]
+```
+
+```mermaid
+wardley
+title Custom Size
+size [800, 1000]
+```
+
+## Complete Example
+
+```mermaid-example
+wardley
+title Software Platform Strategy
+size [1100, 800]
