-anchor Business Customers [0.95, 0.70]
-
-area "Product Features" [0.75, 0.68]
-area "Platform Services" [0.55, 0.52]
-area "Infrastructure" [0.30, 0.88]
-
-component "Dashboard UI" [0.85, 0.65] (build)
